# DUKES UP: proof the whole game can be beaten. From the title, the demo
# player (dku_bot_buttons: real button presses only) picks ROOK and plays
# all five nights, shopping between them, through the lift and both of
# Alderman Grist's forms without a single continue: the good ending, the
# saucer and the alien.
seed 1
game dukesup
wait 5
botuntil state == 4 2000
botuntil night == 2 30000
expect continues == 0
botuntil night == 3 30000
botuntil night == 4 30000
botuntil night == 5 30000
expect continues == 0
botuntil state == 9 40000
expect won == 1
expect continues == 0
expect goals.dukesup == 6
expect save_good == 1
botuntil state == 0 3000
